<title>USA: American BioMed to begin clinical trial.</title>
<headline>American BioMed to begin clinical trial.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American BioMed Inc said on Friday that it will begin clinical trials for its thrombectomy product line, comparing them against Baxter International Inc's embolectomy catheters.</p>
<p>The products aim to treat blocked arteries and arteriosclerosis by allowing surgeons to view the inside of blood vessels and remove plaque inside the blood vessels, American BioMed said.</p>
<p>American BioMed said it expects the trial to be completed within five months.</p>
</text>
